### =====================================================
### TESTE 7 - CRUD
### =====================================================

### Listar usuários

GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

### Consultar usuário

GET http://localhost:3000/usuario/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Listar produtos

GET http://localhost:3000/produtos
Content-Type: application/json

### Consultar produto

GET http://localhost:3000/produto/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Listar compras

GET http://localhost:3000/compras
Content-Type: application/json